  `limsup_{t→+∞} ||(1 − E_W(S_T))P_TΨ_t|| ≤ δ^{-1} ε_W`,

both `= O(λ̃^{d_W}) → 0` in the ordered limit (`t→+∞` at fixed `W`, then
