   ≥ |⟨Ψ_t, Σ_{x∉W}D_xΨ_t⟩| = |Σ_{x∉W}ω_{Ψ_t}(D_x)|`

(Cauchy--Schwarz), and D18(AD3) says that mean tends to `q_leg`.

