     ‖α_{t_+}(𝒩_{W_1})E_{W_m,t_-}({q})Ψ‖²<∞`.

  Equivalently, let
  `S_{NR}:=sup_m sup_{t_-<t_+}[2⟨Ψ,α_{t_-}(𝒩_{W_1})²Ψ⟩
   +2Σ_q‖α_{t_+}(𝒩_{W_1})E_{W_m,t_-}({q})Ψ‖²]<∞`.

