hence **sequentially** compact.  Apply this to `S∋ω^+_{·,T}` along `T=1,2,3,…`
to extract `T_n^{(1)}→∞` with `ω^+_{·,T_n^{(1)}}→ω^+` weak-`*`; apply it again
