derive a uniform bound without it.  C4(c) checks the finite-chain equality
`⟨K|H_XXZ|K⟩=1.1456439081` against `C_K=1.1456439237`.

**Bearing on the live cross-lane obstruction.**  ⟨1⟩5.⟨2⟩4 proves only that
